				<wikidot:authorName>Nagiros</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4665703</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>There are still a number of SPaG errors littered throughout, and the ending action of the Foundation narrowly avoiding a global legal disaster is interesting, but remarkably rushed. The fight scene, however, dragging on for a little too long for my tastes.</p> 
				 	]]>
