					<![CDATA[
						 <p>&quot;of noble blood&quot; what's with that</p> <p>I didn't really enjoy this one; for a few reasons: the action sequence felt unnecessary and cinematic &#8212; sure, it would be neat in a movie, but it's not very compelling written out</p> <p>The idea of cities banning foundation activity is, frankly, kind of ridiculous.</p> 
				 	]]>
